{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"43436fc9045b74d4895111d38313f25732516baa655deaf1052f85b58dfbcea9","ja":"京都でのツアー中の空き時間、\nエミリーと昴は、とある神社を訪れていた……","zh":"在京都巡演期间的空闲时间，\n艾米莉和昴来到了某间神社……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"992f1308be23589fe4967b7b5e07148550a8d7524e5d2e9e34f999bde0b33f6c","ja":"へぇ～。なんかすっげー雰囲気あるな！\n歴史を感じるっていうかさ。","zh":"嘿～。总觉得超有氛围呢！\n该说是能感受到历史底蕴还是什么呢。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"0429d71fcf9a3debffef2871a6875834f274b1211f35e333eb09b0434a7de65f","ja":"はい、荘厳で和の心を感じます。京都に行くなら\nぜひここを訪れたいと思っていて……。","zh":"是的，这里庄严肃穆，能让人感受到和之心。\n我一直想着如果去京都的话，一定要来这里看看……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"7b01270b6f709626dc65c98f96bfbc35ee4b76f774317593106ecabe370fdcca","ja":"……あらっ？　あそこにいらっしゃるのは……。","zh":"……哎呀？在那里的那位是……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"7b091e2ea9df2160549ba93b4c0b851c3d82f675a3029d3ab9151d0540bb3570","ja":"ん？　どうしたんだ、エミリー。\nそっちは誰もいないけど……？","zh":"嗯？怎么了吗，艾米莉。\n那边明明谁都没有啊……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"2517df1df8ca8aa335d09f03877d277f4cde233bfaf286b33d20b60a74bceb9c","ja":"えっ？　でも、和服を着た女の子が……。","zh":"咦？可是，穿和服的女孩子……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"3a63875f07809964ff831a16df6440be71d61084fdf8172427c44b2332557f0e","ja":"「ねぇ、来て……こっち！」","zh":"“呐，过来……这边！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"b5863e1d40c671cf7a0a139b432122c00c5b034af801d04ab1ca511bc529ea97","ja":"……呼んでる。\nなにか、困ったことがあったのでしょうか……？","zh":"……在叫我。\n是遇到了什么麻烦事吗……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"592ae06234e79dd36c6bae546c327a23df6c1973731cae124cb0b1f4861264f8","ja":"へっ！？　エミリー！\nおい……！？","zh":"欸！？　艾米莉！\n喂……！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1074.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"52b098eac19b4c85bcca88dc1415cb48c18c189c06357d3ba9785f0b43a42773","ja":"ひとりでどこ行くんだよ！？\n待てって！","zh":"你要一个人去哪儿啊！？\n等等我啊！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T14:00:23+00:00"}
